(Bug #82 reached both runtime parsers: a buffer-typed cast goes through
 the length-bounded routine, which carried the identical
 divide-once-per-digit loop. The buffer path has to agree with the
 literal for the same values the text path does, including a buffer
 filled a byte at a time and one cleared and refilled - the shapes that
 exercise the bounded scan rather than a NUL terminator.)

a buffer called spelled is "0.88".
a float called parsed is spelled as a float.
If parsed is 0.88 then, Print "0.88 from a buffer: same double". Otherwise, Print "0.88 from a buffer: DIFFERENT".
Print "{parsed:.17}".

a buffer called reported is "0.23".
a float called 'reported parsed' is reported as a float.
If 'reported parsed' is 0.23 then, Print "0.23 from a buffer: same double". Otherwise, Print "0.23 from a buffer: DIFFERENT".

Create a buffer called written.
Set byte 1 of written to '0'.
Set byte 2 of written to '.'.
Set byte 3 of written to '4'.
Set byte 4 of written to '4'.
a float called 'written parsed' is written as a float.
If 'written parsed' is 0.44 then, Print "0.44 byte by byte: same double". Otherwise, Print "0.44 byte by byte: DIFFERENT".

clear written.
Set byte 1 of written to '2'.
Set byte 2 of written to '.'.
Set byte 3 of written to '5'.
Set byte 4 of written to '3'.
a float called 'refilled parsed' is written as a float.
If 'refilled parsed' is 2.53 then, Print "2.53 after a clear: same double". Otherwise, Print "2.53 after a clear: DIFFERENT".

a buffer called owed is "-0.88".
a float called 'owed parsed' is owed as a float.
If 'owed parsed' is -0.88 then, Print "-0.88 from a buffer: same double". Otherwise, Print "-0.88 from a buffer: DIFFERENT".

(An empty buffer has no digits at all. The bounded parser used to leave
 on that path without ever writing its result register, so the cast
 handed back whatever float had been computed last - print this line on
 the old runtime and it says -0.88, the value above it. Zero now.)
a buffer called blank is "".
a float called 'blank parsed' is blank as a float.
Print 'blank parsed'.
